    {
      "id": "controls",
      "kind": "panel",
      "title": "Double pendulum",
      "widgets": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Two double pendulums, started a hundredth of a degree apart. For a few seconds they swing as one, then they split and never agree again. That's chaos: a tiny difference grows until it's everything."
        },
        {
          "type": "stat",
